{"title": "Chain Lightning", "pageid": 7950, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Chain_Lightning", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 6 Spells", "Evocation spells", "Spells that can be transcribed", "Dexterity saving throws", "Actions", "Sources of Lightning damage", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chain_Lightning.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Chain_Lightning.webp/300px-Chain_Lightning.webp, /w/images/a/a0/Chain_Lightning.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Chain_Lightning.webp/300px-Chain_Lightning.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Chain_Lightning.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Chain Lightning </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 6 evocation spell</a>. It allows casters to create a bolt of lightning which strikes a target and chains to nearby enemies.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nStrike an enemy with lightning. Three more bolts will leap from the target, electrifying as many as three other enemies within range.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 6 Spell Slot</a></dd><dt>Damage: 10~80</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/D8_Lightning.png/26px-D8_Lightning.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/D8_Lightning.png/40px-D8_Lightning.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/D8_Lightning.png/53px-D8_Lightning.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/D8_Lightning.png/26px-D8_Lightning.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/D8_Lightning.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">10d8</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (On Save: Targets still take half damage.)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/25px-Party_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/38px-Party_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/50px-Party_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Targets: 1 primary target and 3 enemies within 18 m (60 ft) of the primary target\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/25px-Party_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Party_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Targets: 1 primary target and 3 enemies within 18 m (60 ft) of the primary target</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Projectile_ChainLightning</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_ChainLightning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_ChainLightning\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 11: <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a></li></ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Markoheshkir\" title=\"Markoheshkir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Markoheshkir\" title=\"Markoheshkir\">Markoheshkir</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 6 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Chain_Lightning\" title=\"Scroll of Chain Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Scroll_of_Chain_Lightning_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Chain_Lightning_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Scroll_of_Chain_Lightning_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Chain_Lightning_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Scroll_of_Chain_Lightning_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Chain_Lightning_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Scroll_of_Chain_Lightning_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Chain_Lightning_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Scroll_of_Chain_Lightning_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Chain_Lightning\" title=\"Scroll of Chain Lightning\">Scroll of Chain Lightning</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Since Patch 6, Chain Lightning cannot be used with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Twinned_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Twinned Spell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp/20px-Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp/30px-Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp/40px-Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Metamagic: Twinned Spell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp/20px-Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Metamagic_Twinned_Spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Twinned_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Twinned Spell\">Metamagic: Twinned Spell</a>. However, this restriction does not apply to the version of Chain Lightning granted by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Markoheshkir\" title=\"Markoheshkir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Markoheshkir\" title=\"Markoheshkir\">Markoheshkir</a>.</li>\n<li>Characters under the effects of an <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Bloodlust\" title=\"Elixir of Bloodlust\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Bloodlust\" title=\"Elixir of Bloodlust\">Elixir of Bloodlust</a> can use this spell to gain an additional action point by targeting the spell at an object. When the object \"dies\" and a living creature is then hit by the same effect, the game gives the caster an additional action for killing an enemy, as per the Elixir. This also works with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Many_Targets\" title=\"Arrow of Many Targets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Arrow_of_Many_Targets_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Many_Targets\" title=\"Arrow of Many Targets\">Arrow of Many Targets</a>.</li>\n<li>The DC of the saving throw to reduce damage from the lightning chains uses the spellcasting modifier of the most recently acquired spellcasting class, rather than the spellcasting modifier that was used for the initial casting of Chain Lightning.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This spell lacks an <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code> <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_flags\" title=\"Spell flags\">spell flag</a>, and as such is able to target creatures affected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Sanctuary (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Sanctuary (Condition)\">Sanctuary</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chain_lightning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chain lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chain_lightning\">Chain lightning</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034050\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐t